order first: B, B, H, J, O.</p>\n\n<p>We need to systematically count the words while following dictionary order:</p>\n\n<p>1. Words starting with B:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>Next position letters: B, H, J, O</li>\n\n<li>Number of permutations: <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.783ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.52ex\" height=\"2.82ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -900.3 3323.7 1246.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"21\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-21\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-346.3) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"21\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-21\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"750.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1267.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2323.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> words</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<p>Since 24 words starting with 'B' exist and are less than 50, Move to next starting letter alphabetically.</p>\n\n<p>2. Words starting with H:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>Next position letters: B, B, J, O</li>\n\n<li>Number of permutations: <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.783ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.52ex\" height=\"2.82ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -900.3 3323.7 1246.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"21\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-21\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-346.3) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"21\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-21\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"750.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1267.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2323.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> words</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<p>After 'B', tally becomes 24 (B-words) + 12 (H-words) = 36, needs more.</p>\n\n<p>3. Words starting with J:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>Next position letters: B, B, H, O</li>\n\n<li>Number of permutations: <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.783ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.52ex\" height=\"2.82ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -900.3 3323.7 1246.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"tran